OL,3,AAirlines criticise air traffic control
OL,4,Aas second glitch causes more disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FNats said a "connectivity issue" at
OL,7,FPrestwick was behind the disruption
OL,8,Facross Scotland, Northern Ireland and
OL,9,Fnorthern England - and had "nothing to
OL,10,Fdo" with a separate software defect at
OL,11,FSwanwick earlier this month.
OL,13,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said
OL,14,Ffurther issues today "cause even
OL,15,Fgreater concern" about the UK's air
OL,16,Ftraffic control.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
