OL,3,AManchester to host world leaders at G20
OL,4,Asummit in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorld leaders, including Donald Trump,
OL,7,Fwill head to Manchester next year for
OL,8,Fthe G20 leaders' summit.
OL,10,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who is the
OL,11,Fformer mayor of Greater Manchester,
OL,12,Fsaid he was "really pleased" he would
OL,13,Fbe welcoming the US president to the
OL,14,Fcity.
OL,16,FThe G20 summit, an annual gathering of
OL,17,Fthe world's biggest economies, will
OL,18,Ftake place on 27 and 28 November 2027
OL,19,Fat the Manchester Central Convention
OL,20,FCentre. It will be the largest summit
OL,21,Fever held in the city.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
