OL,3,AManchester to host world leaders at G20
OL,4,Asummit in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FManchester was chosen earlier this
OL,7,Fyear, prior to Burnham becoming prime
OL,8,Fminister. Downing Street said
OL,9,Fpreparations will now step up, with
OL,10,Fhundreds of local people expected to be
OL,11,Finvolved.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
