OL,3,AMartha's Rule rolled out at every A&E
OL,4,Adepartment in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS is expanding Martha's Rule to
OL,7,Fall hospital emergency departments in
OL,8,FEngland to help patients and families
OL,9,Fchallenge staff and seek second
OL,10,Fopinions about their care if they want.
OL,12,FIt is named after Martha Mills, who
OL,13,Fdied aged 13 at King's College Hospital
OL,14,Fin London in 2021 after developing
OL,15,Fblood poisoning or sepsis. Her family's
OL,16,Fconcerns were not listened to, which
OL,17,Flater prompted her parents, Merope and
OL,18,FPaul, to change that culture by
OL,19,Fcreating the rule.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790052453
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMartha's Rule rolled out at every A&E
OL,4,Adepartment in England
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients, loved ones and staff in A&E
OL,7,Funits will be able to call a dedicated
OL,8,Fphone number to trigger an urgent
OL,9,Freview if a patient's condition is
OL,10,Fdeteriorating and they are concerned
OL,11,Fthis is not being listened to.
OL,13,FThe nationwide expansion starts now and
OL,14,Fshould be complete by March 2028,
OL,15,Ffollowing a successful trial at seven
OL,16,Ftrusts. It is already being rolled out
OL,17,Facross all inpatient wards.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
